{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38060","headline":"闲居 · 韩偓","name":"闲居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"厌闻趋竞喜闲居，自种芜菁亦自锄。\n麋鹿跳梁忧触拨，鹰鸇搏击恐麤疎。\n拙谋却爲多循理，所短深慙尽信书。\n刀尺不亏绳墨在，莫疑张翰恋鲈鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38060.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38060","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}